  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "进程壳的四件事",
      "items": [
        "场景入口：Boot.unity 上唯一引导件，执行序 -1000，重复引导静默销毁并保留首个",
        "宿主：new ClientHost() + 同 GameObject 上 AppLifetime.Bind（Pause / Focus / LowMemory / Quit 与退出善后）",
        "入口装载：反射取 IClientEntry → Configure → 等宿主初始化 → StartAsync",
        "错误面：内建 uGUI（不经资源包），固定锚 [BootstrapError]；UI 自身失败只落日志，不吞原错"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "AOT 壳的边界",
      "items": [
        "LiteGame.Bootstrap 只引 LiteFramework.{Core, Services, Hosting} + UniTask，不引 LiteGame.App / Modules / Adapters",
        "ClientEntryLoader 是 AOT 侧唯一反射点：Type.GetType(\"LiteGame.ClientEntry, LiteGame.App\")",
        "解析不到或类型未实现 IClientEntry 直接抛，不静默降级成“空启动”；link.xml preserve LiteGame.App",
        "IClientEntry 只有两个方法：Configure(host, hostObject) 与 StartAsync(ct)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "启动时序与帧泵",
      "items": [
        "Awake：重复守护 → 建宿主 → 绑 AppLifetime → Load / Configure → DontDestroyOnLoad → InitializeAsync",
        "Start：等初始化结果 → StartAsync（开发调参、探针武装、fsm.Start(Launch)）",
        "Update：按索引遍历 container.Tickables，统一喂 Time.unscaledDeltaTime（缩放由 IGameClock 内部做）",
        "OnDestroy：取消引导期异步 → 复位 UIAnimationClock 与 s_booted（Domain-Reload-Off 可重入）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "失败与重入",
      "items": [
        "任一段异常 → ErrorRecoveryService.Classify（Transient / Recoverable / Compatibility / Security / Fatal）→ 错误页",
        "初始化失败：宿主逆序回滚已成功段，原异常再抛给引导件统一转错误 UI",
        "装载或初始化失败后 s_booted 复位——允许下一场重新引导，不留跨 Play 死锁",
        "编辑器关闭域重载时 ResetForEditorReload 复位静态（GameEntry 与 UIAnimationClock）"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
